cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Weight·Expression Lab: Same recipe, different weights"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible experiment that trains a small neural network (MLP 64-128-10) on the
  scikit-learn digits dataset from scratch and measures the relationship between training
  settings, predictions, and weight values. Experiment A varies hidden size and learning rate;
  experiment B fixes the settings and varies the random seed, comparing weights by cosine
  similarity before and after hidden-unit permutation and ReLU rescaling alignment;
  experiment C permutes the hidden units of one trained model. Includes a command-line
  script and a PyQt6 desktop application.
